{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0473_1000_004yuk", "source_sha256": "b4b549c2383643c0acf815a725a5354250fbce5a769f395659f51d5d441b40c8", "ja": "楽しかったなぁ……。イルミネーションも、\n綺麗だったし、それにプレゼントも……ふふふっ♪", "zh": "真开心啊……灯饰也很漂亮，而且还有礼物……呵呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0473_1001_p", "source_sha256": "dea154256fc16e4ff29925388dad0ad5ad96f58b80a455af88c12e9ac07c1144", "ja": "お疲れ様、雪歩。\nなんだか機嫌がいいみたいだな。", "zh": "辛苦了，雪步。\n感觉你心情很不错嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0473_1002_004yuk", "source_sha256": "ac1e9d1ed3f5525889b1f941f70a6915b11ddc418246358817fb885db8d3656d", "ja": "ひゃっ！？　{$P$}！\nい、いつからそこに……？", "zh": "呀！？{$P$}！\n你、你什么时候到那里的……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0473_1003_p", "source_sha256": "44c91f4d2d3eb07613bfaa78b7760f8a524d3119a26a0900efd1cab4a4bb9a11", "ja": "ご、ごめん。今だよ。ちょうど雪歩の姿が見えたから、\n声をかけたんだ。何か見てたようだけど……？", "zh": "对、对不起。就是现在。我刚好看到雪步的身影，\n所以就叫了你一声。你好像在看什么……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0473_1004_004yuk", "source_sha256": "16b9ae7e009b3e09ea4b907920368af4c48106157869ddcbc84d727f64dc1ecd", "ja": "そうだったんですか。\nえっと……実は、写真を見てたんです。", "zh": "原来是这样啊。\n那个……其实我刚才在看照片。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0473_1005_004yuk", "source_sha256": "9469f349600527220688e651e81756448de650229b6384464687e1a7f13671a6", "ja": "この前一緒に行ったイルミネーションとか……\n{$P$}にもらったプレゼントとか。", "zh": "比如之前一起去看的灯饰……\n还有从{$P$}那里收到的礼物。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0473_1006_p", "source_sha256": "3518c792c9d68209cada8b4656cd31ee36743e2bc56852dcdd0c43c406012f69", "ja": "そういえば、イルミネーションの写真、撮ってたな。\n景色はわかるけど……プレゼントも？", "zh": "说起来，我还拍过灯饰的照片呢。\n风景还好理解……连礼物也拍了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0473_1007_004yuk", "source_sha256": "b4f4229c9263cd50005a3aefa1084db1558253d539eac90fbf374d3f7221a06e", "ja": "はい。ぜんぶ、素敵な思い出ですから。\n写真を撮って、大切にしてるんです。", "zh": "是的。因为这些全都是美好的回忆。\n我会拍下照片，好好珍藏。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0473_1008_004yuk", "source_sha256": "697ccf652178fb03819b918cb6bd516187f7671365d9b2c4be889cd303beb89a", "ja": "たまに見返すと、元気がもらえて……。あっ。\nもちろん花束もアクセサリーも、大事にしてますよ！", "zh": "偶尔翻看时，就会让我重新打起精神……啊。  \n当然，花束和饰品我也都很珍惜哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0473_1009_p", "source_sha256": "d8c7556dc9ce93f75a2dd1a970d6fa51b8eb125993f0da78796824689bbdc6b1", "ja": "そうか……。ありがとう。\n雪歩がそんなに喜んでくれるとは思わなかったよ。", "zh": "这样啊……谢谢你。\n没想到雪步会这么高兴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0473_1010_004yuk", "source_sha256": "54b8d20dd28e17d0cc883a0e2319d83a89881041b0097403573acfd0c643a1fd", "ja": "えへへ。嬉しかったんです。{$P$}の\n気持ちが伝わってきたっていうか……。", "zh": "嘿嘿。我真的很开心。该说是感受到了{$P$}的心意……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0473_1011_004yuk", "source_sha256": "415b0cd8cce47e44ba2438c70a54c1bc52abf8ed6dd028f73d60be7a41a64399", "ja": "私のために、一生懸命選んでくれたんだなって\n感じられて。一生忘れられない、素敵な思い出です♪", "zh": "我能感受到，你是在为我努力挑选礼物。一生都无法忘记的美好回忆呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0473_1012_p", "source_sha256": "5016dbe7977e4f7eb4b66cbac5393ee6c2aeace3508e6671a043ddfa29cf6bb6", "ja": "はは、そんな風に言われると、\n来年のプレゼントはハードルが上がるな。", "zh": "哈哈，被你这么一说，明年的礼物可就难办了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0473_1013_004yuk", "source_sha256": "5efcea1171b5ed19850e51f817a2afc1fb982dd069bc42c50445fb940692a69f", "ja": "えっ？　来年……ですか？", "zh": "咦？明年……吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0473_1014_p", "source_sha256": "fc3767daf0149d98032f5cf08f62d9ad5a1abc8894177d95ea5b56293c801459", "ja": "ああ。来年だけじゃなくて、その先もずっと……。\n何度でも雪歩の誕生日をお祝いしたいからね。", "zh": "嗯。不只是明年，今后也会一直……  \n因为我想一次又一次地为雪步庆祝生日。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0473_1015_004yuk", "source_sha256": "641cc82d3adca60b858ea2e1a88fc6ab176261e33b9885d28a43493097869981", "ja": "その先も……。\nこれからもずっと、一緒に……。", "zh": "再往后也……  \n今后也要一直在一起……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0473_1016_004yuk", "source_sha256": "527167b0e43945dbf07f6e7704841925981dc441556765b248987e04fca93958", "ja": "……えへへ。{$P$}から、\nまた嬉しいプレゼントをもらっちゃいましたぁ♪", "zh": "……嘿嘿。我又从{$P$}那里，\n收到了好开心的礼物呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
